Subject: test-backend-ops: cover dense projection rows around a dispatch boundary

Use synthetic data and upstream's CPU reference. Deliberately straddle the
experimental workgroup boundary and include larger controls, odd row counts
and both short and long reductions. This patch changes only the test tool.
Performance mode times one synchronized graph at a time, not repeated
copies of the same output node in a submission. Export host time and count.

